// FreeLang Phase I Week 2: Realistic Chaos Scenarios
// Day 8-9: Scenario 1 - Tail Latency Under Load
// Day 9-10: Scenario 2 - Memory Degradation (placeholder)
// Day 10-11: Scenario 3 - I/O Bottleneck (placeholder)
